 "description": "Welcome to Gray Area!\n\nOur mission is to unite the international house music community. We curate events that reveal new and exciting talent to dancers across the planet. Our digital content is a powerful discovery tool that connects fans to the stories of their favorite artists. And our event discovery platform expands global event brands and festivals to new territories.\n\nGray Area exposes the connective tissue between sub-genres and sub-cultures in an effort to unify the dance floor. Dance music isn’t what we do, it’s who we are. Let there be MORE house music!\n\nLatest Artist Spotlights - https://grayarea.co/artists\nLatest Magazine articles - https://grayarea.co/magazine\n",
